{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/6e33094fcb1c4a1d6a3bcba3c043afc4.avif?t=1761837560\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a text\u2011based game where choices drive the narrative. You play as \u201cme,\u201d and your decisions will determine my fate\u2014and the fate of the entire game (world).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/4a006e19bbf36276feed5826a31e2a30.avif?t=1761837560\" width=609 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: there is only ONE main route!!! Your choices will influence \u201cmy\u201d thoughts and can ultimately trigger a BAD END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Wild Imagination]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The script is adapted from one of two short stories I wrote in middle school. The writing might be a bit rough, but I promise the imagination will surprise you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/8eaec512431a1848626eaba46c462802.avif?t=1761837560\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2a7173b319db276e28e211f9b3acfe74.avif?t=1761837560\" width=699 height=343 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/2af8ce28ec244780c04e168a00af4dc2.avif?t=1761837560\" width=699 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/dc73bbe7bbb0d5e7f758a4218a0db6b8.avif?t=1761837560\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All people and events in this story exist in a virtual space and have no relation to the real world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/extras/0af7f9d7377ec4107cf5328172954650.avif?t=1761837560\" width=609 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I\u2019m Shifeifan, an indie game developer from China. You\u2019re welcome to follow my Bilibili account \u201c\u6b63\u5e38\u7684\u4e00\u4e2a\u4eba.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can also add my WeChat for conversation, or send bug reports and suggestions to my email\u2014many thanks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WeChat: blackbird_3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Email: QQ: 3362669785</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113920?t=1761837560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113920?t=1761837560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/cb6dbc3e3ac9b45dd1c17757420605838531c94d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761837560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113920/cb6dbc3e3ac9b45dd1c17757420605838531c94d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761837560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=